{
  "parse": {
    "title": "Cocooning",
    "pageid": 110118,
    "revid": 862099,
    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"infobox\"><div class=\"infobox-title\">Cocooning</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><span class=\"mw-default-size pi-image-thumbnail\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Cocooning_Example.gif\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Cocooning Example.gif\"><img alt=\"Cocooning Example.gif\" src=\"/images/Cocooning_Example.gif?b403c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"554\" height=\"592\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"554\" data-file-height=\"592\" /></a></span></span></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>Cocooning</b> is a feature that allows killed <a href=\"/w/Mobs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mobs\">Mobs</a> to respawn.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Mechanics\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Mechanics</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Increasing_Cocoon_Chance\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Increasing Cocoon Chance</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Interactions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Interactions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Bugs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Bugs</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cocooning?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Mechanics\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cocooning?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Mechanics\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Upon triggering a cocoon event, three egg sacs will appear where the mob was killed, shifting for several seconds. After <span class=\"light-color color-green\">6</span> seconds, the killed mob will reappear at full <span class=\"color-red\">HP<span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><a href=\"/w/Health\" title=\"Health\"><span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xe010;</span></span></a></span></span>. Additionally, the following message will display:\n</p>\n<div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-a\"><span class=\"format-l\">CAUGHT! </span></span><span class=\"format-c\">You cocooned a </span><span class=\"format-6\">&lt;mob name&gt;</span><span class=\"format-c\">!</span></div></div>\n<p>The player who cocooned the mob will become its owner, regardless of the original mob's owner.\n</p><p>If the killed mob could spawn as <a href=\"/w/Runecrafting#Runic_Mobs\" title=\"Runecrafting\">Runic</a><sup><i>&#91;<abbr title=\"Confirmation needed; When this info is confirmed, remove this.\">Confirm</abbr>&#93;</i></sup> or <a href=\"/w/Corrupted_Mobs\" title=\"Corrupted Mobs\">Corrupted</a>, the cocooned mob will also have a chance to have those traits too. The cocooned mob acts like a naturally spawned mob, and is eligible for <a href=\"/w/Bestiary\" title=\"Bestiary\">Bestiary</a>, <a href=\"/w/Drop_Chance\" title=\"Drop Chance\">mob drops</a>, and <a href=\"/w/Slayer\" title=\"Slayer\">Slayer XP</a>. The original mob will still be able to naturally respawn while the cocooned mob is alive.\n</p><p>Cocooning still works on mobs spawned from cocooning, allowing players to chain these events.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Increasing_Cocoon_Chance\">Increasing Cocoon Chance</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cocooning?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Increasing Cocoon Chance\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cocooning?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Increasing Cocoon Chance\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/The_Primordial\" title=\"The Primordial\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/The_Primordial.png/21px-The_Primordial.png?923bc\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/The_Primordial.png/42px-The_Primordial.png?923bc 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/The_Primordial\" title=\"The Primordial\">The Primordial</a> grants a <span class=\"light-color color-green\">10%</span> chance to cocoon <a href=\"/w/Slayer\" title=\"Slayer\">Slayer Bosses</a> and <a href=\"/w/Slayer\" title=\"Slayer\">Slayer Minibosses</a>.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/w/Reforging#Bloodshot\" title=\"Reforging\">Bloodshot</a> reforge grants a <span class=\"light-color color-green\">2.5%</span> chance to cocoon most non-boss mobs outside <a href=\"/w/Dungeons\" title=\"Dungeons\">Dungeons</a> and <a href=\"/w/Kuudra%27s_Hollow\" title=\"Kuudra&#39;s Hollow\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">&#xe067; </span></span><span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\">Kuudra's Hollow</span></a>.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/w/Attributes#Cocoon_Chance\" title=\"Attributes\">Cocoon Chance</a> <a href=\"/w/Attributes\" title=\"Attributes\">Attribute</a> grants an additional <span class=\"light-color color-green\">+5%</span> chance to cocoon <a href=\"/w/Slayer\" title=\"Slayer\">Slayer Bosses</a> and <a href=\"/w/Slayer\" title=\"Slayer\">Slayer Minibosses</a> when using <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/The_Primordial\" title=\"The Primordial\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/The_Primordial.png/21px-The_Primordial.png?923bc\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/The_Primordial.png/42px-The_Primordial.png?923bc 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/The_Primordial\" title=\"The Primordial\">The Primordial</a>.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"messagebox boxcol-green\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"messagebox-main\">\n<div class=\"messagebox-image nomobile\" style=\"\">\n<p><span class=\"notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Oak_Sapling.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Oak_Sapling.png/30px-Oak_Sapling.png?3a87e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Oak_Sapling.png/60px-Oak_Sapling.png?3a87e 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"messagebox-text\" style=\"\">\n<p>This section needs more information. Please help <a class=\"text\" href=\"https://hypixelskyblock.minecraft.wiki/w/Cocooning?action=edit\">expand it</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"messagebox-aside\">\n<div class=\"messagebox-rtext\" style=\"\">\n<p><a href=\"/w/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">See more stubs.</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>List of mobs that cannot be cocooned:<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-cocoon-list&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-cocoon-list-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-cocoon-list-2&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-cocoon-list-2-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Mobs in <a href=\"/w/Dungeons\" title=\"Dungeons\">Dungeons</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Sven_Pup\" title=\"Sven Pup\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Sven Pup in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Wolf_%28baby%29_Sprite.png/16px-Wolf_%28baby%29_Sprite.png?a2bee\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Wolf_%28baby%29_Sprite.png/32px-Wolf_%28baby%29_Sprite.png?a2bee 2x\" data-file-width=\"248\" data-file-height=\"288\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Sven_Pup\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sven Pup\">Sven Pups</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Puddle_Jumper\" title=\"Puddle Jumper\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Puddle Jumper in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Frog_%28Temperate%29_Sprite.png/16px-Frog_%28Temperate%29_Sprite.png?d15dc\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Frog_%28Temperate%29_Sprite.png/32px-Frog_%28Temperate%29_Sprite.png?d15dc 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Puddle_Jumper\" title=\"Puddle Jumper\">Puddle Jumper</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Zombuddy\" title=\"Zombuddy\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Zombuddy in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Zombuddy_Sprite.png/16px-Zombuddy_Sprite.png?852ff\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Zombuddy_Sprite.png/32px-Zombuddy_Sprite.png?852ff 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"288\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Zombuddy\" title=\"Zombuddy\">Zombuddy</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Timestalk_Clone\" title=\"Timestalk Clone\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Timestalk Clone in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Steve_Sprite.png/16px-Steve_Sprite.png?7ad27\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Steve_Sprite.png/32px-Steve_Sprite.png?7ad27 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Timestalk_Clone\" title=\"Timestalk Clone\">Timestalk Clone</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Sphinx\" title=\"Sphinx\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Sphinx in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Sphinx_Sprite.png/16px-Sphinx_Sprite.png?52ea4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Sphinx_Sprite.png/32px-Sphinx_Sprite.png?52ea4 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"288\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Sphinx\" title=\"Sphinx\">Sphinx</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Siamese_Lynx\" title=\"Siamese Lynx\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Siamese Lynx in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Cat_%28Black%29_Sprite.png/16px-Cat_%28Black%29_Sprite.png?abb16\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Cat_%28Black%29_Sprite.png/32px-Cat_%28Black%29_Sprite.png?abb16 2x\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"240\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Siamese_Lynx\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Siamese Lynx\">Siamese Lynx</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Chickzilla\" title=\"Chickzilla\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Chickzilla in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Gulliver_Sprite.png/16px-Gulliver_Sprite.png?4cfab\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Gulliver_Sprite.png/32px-Gulliver_Sprite.png?4cfab 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"288\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Chickzilla\" title=\"Chickzilla\">Chickzilla</a></li>\n<li>Any Dragon, including <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Ender_Dragon\" title=\"Ender Dragon\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Ender Dragon in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Ender_Dragon_Sprite.png/16px-Ender_Dragon_Sprite.png?619eb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Ender_Dragon_Sprite.png/32px-Ender_Dragon_Sprite.png?619eb 2x\" data-file-width=\"178\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Ender_Dragon\" title=\"Ender Dragon\">Ender Dragon</a>, <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Reindrake\" title=\"Reindrake\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Reindrake in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Ender_Dragon_Sprite.png/16px-Ender_Dragon_Sprite.png?619eb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Ender_Dragon_Sprite.png/32px-Ender_Dragon_Sprite.png?619eb 2x\" data-file-width=\"178\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Reindrake\" title=\"Reindrake\">Reindrake</a> and <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Withered_Dragon\" title=\"Withered Dragon\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Withered Dragon in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Ender_Dragon_Sprite.png/16px-Ender_Dragon_Sprite.png?619eb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Ender_Dragon_Sprite.png/32px-Ender_Dragon_Sprite.png?619eb 2x\" data-file-width=\"178\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Withered_Dragon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Withered Dragon\">Withered Dragon</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Bambuleaf\" title=\"Bambuleaf\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Bambuleaf in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Panda_Sprite.png/16px-Panda_Sprite.png?4a4b1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Panda_Sprite.png/32px-Panda_Sprite.png?4a4b1 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"104\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Bambuleaf\" title=\"Bambuleaf\">Bambuleaf</a> and <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Mochibear\" title=\"Mochibear\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Mochibear in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Brown_Panda_Sprite.png/16px-Brown_Panda_Sprite.png?e94b0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Brown_Panda_Sprite.png/32px-Brown_Panda_Sprite.png?e94b0 2x\" data-file-width=\"84\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Mochibear\" title=\"Mochibear\">Mochibear</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/End_Stone_Protector\" title=\"End Stone Protector\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing End Stone Protector in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Iron_Golem_Sprite.png/16px-Iron_Golem_Sprite.png?4a4b1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Iron_Golem_Sprite.png/32px-Iron_Golem_Sprite.png?4a4b1 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"88\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/End_Stone_Protector\" title=\"End Stone Protector\">End Stone Protector</a></li>\n<li>Most fish shard entities, like <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Lotusfish\" title=\"Lotusfish\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Lotusfish in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Lotusfish_Sprite.png/16px-Lotusfish_Sprite.png?7db4e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Lotusfish_Sprite.png/32px-Lotusfish_Sprite.png?7db4e 2x\" data-file-width=\"192\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Lotusfish\" title=\"Lotusfish\">Lotusfish</a> or <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Azure\" title=\"Azure\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Azure in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Azure_Sprite.png/16px-Azure_Sprite.png?194a3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Azure_Sprite.png/32px-Azure_Sprite.png?194a3 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"32\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Azure\" title=\"Azure\">Azure</a></li>\n<li>Multi-layered mobs, like <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Scatha\" title=\"Scatha\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Scatha in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Scatha_Sprite.png/16px-Scatha_Sprite.png?6fca5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Scatha_Sprite.png/32px-Scatha_Sprite.png?6fca5 2x\" data-file-width=\"287\" data-file-height=\"286\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Scatha\" title=\"Scatha\">Scatha</a> or <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Fire_Eel\" title=\"Fire Eel\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Fire Eel in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Fire_Eel_Sprite.png/16px-Fire_Eel_Sprite.png?4b495\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Fire_Eel_Sprite.png/32px-Fire_Eel_Sprite.png?4b495 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Fire_Eel\" title=\"Fire Eel\">Fire Eel</a> <sup><i>&#91;<abbr title=\"Confirmation needed; When this info is confirmed, remove this.\">Confirm</abbr>&#93;</i></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Wiki_Tiki\" title=\"Wiki Tiki\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Wiki Tiki in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Wiki_Tiki_Sprite.png/16px-Wiki_Tiki_Sprite.png?ecb69\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Wiki_Tiki_Sprite.png/32px-Wiki_Tiki_Sprite.png?ecb69 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"272\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Wiki_Tiki\" title=\"Wiki Tiki\">Wiki Tiki</a> and <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Wiki_Tiki_Laser_Totem\" title=\"Wiki Tiki Laser Totem\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Wiki Tiki Laser Totem in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Wiki_Tiki_Sprite.png/16px-Wiki_Tiki_Sprite.png?ecb69\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Wiki_Tiki_Sprite.png/32px-Wiki_Tiki_Sprite.png?ecb69 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"272\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Wiki_Tiki_Laser_Totem\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wiki Tiki Laser Totem\">Wiki Tiki Laser Totem</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Jockey_Skeleton\" title=\"Jockey Skeleton\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Jockey Skeleton in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Skeleton_Sprite.png/16px-Skeleton_Sprite.png?eaa03\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Skeleton_Sprite.png/32px-Skeleton_Sprite.png?eaa03 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Jockey_Skeleton\" title=\"Jockey Skeleton\">Jockey Skeleton</a></li>\n<li>Mobs riding other entities, like <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Rider_of_the_Deep\" title=\"Rider of the Deep\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Rider of the Deep in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Rider_of_the_Deep_Sprite.png/16px-Rider_of_the_Deep_Sprite.png?50c03\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Rider_of_the_Deep_Sprite.png/32px-Rider_of_the_Deep_Sprite.png?50c03 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Rider_of_the_Deep\" title=\"Rider of the Deep\">Rider of the Deep</a>, cannot be cocooned, meaning only bottom part rolls for cocoon chance.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Pest_(Mob_Type)\" title=\"Pest (Mob Type)\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-dark&#95;green\" style=\"\">&#xe07f;&#160;Pest</span></span></a><sup><i>&#91;<abbr title=\"Confirmation needed; When this info is confirmed, remove this.\">Confirm</abbr>&#93;</i></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Hideonleaf\" title=\"Hideonleaf\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Hideonleaf in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Green_Shulker_Sprite.png/16px-Green_Shulker_Sprite.png?ebfcb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Green_Shulker_Sprite.png/32px-Green_Shulker_Sprite.png?ebfcb 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"288\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Hideonleaf\" title=\"Hideonleaf\">Hideonleaf</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Primordial_Bat\" title=\"Primordial Bat\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Primordial Bat in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Bat_Sprite.png/16px-Bat_Sprite.png?4a4b1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Bat_Sprite.png/32px-Bat_Sprite.png?4a4b1 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"48\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Primordial_Bat\" title=\"Primordial Bat\">Primordial Bat</a>, <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Primordial_Hatchling\" title=\"Primordial Hatchling\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Primordial Hatchling in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Spider_Sprite.png/16px-Spider_Sprite.png?4a4b1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Spider_Sprite.png/32px-Spider_Sprite.png?4a4b1 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Primordial_Hatchling\" title=\"Primordial Hatchling\">Primordial Hatchling</a> and <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Primordial_Minion\" title=\"Primordial Minion\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Primordial Minion in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Spider_Sprite.png/16px-Spider_Sprite.png?4a4b1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Spider_Sprite.png/32px-Spider_Sprite.png?4a4b1 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Primordial_Minion\" title=\"Primordial Minion\">Primordial Minion</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Rollim\" title=\"Rollim\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Rollim in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Alwin_Sprite.png/16px-Alwin_Sprite.png?8dfed\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Alwin_Sprite.png/32px-Alwin_Sprite.png?8dfed 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"272\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Rollim\" title=\"Rollim\">Rollim</a> and <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Kaus\" title=\"Kaus\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Kaus in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Igor_Sprite.png/16px-Igor_Sprite.png?5736c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Igor_Sprite.png/32px-Igor_Sprite.png?5736c 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"288\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Kaus\" title=\"Kaus\">Kaus</a></li></ul>\n<p>Mobs that can be cocooned despite being bosses include: \n</p>\n<ul><li>Crimson Isle <a href=\"/w/Minibosses\" title=\"Minibosses\">Minibosses</a> and related entities, like <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Summoned_Skull\" title=\"Summoned Skull\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Summoned Skull in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Wither_Skeleton_Sprite.png/16px-Wither_Skeleton_Sprite.png?31f4b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Wither_Skeleton_Sprite.png/32px-Wither_Skeleton_Sprite.png?31f4b 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Summoned_Skull\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Summoned Skull\">Summoned Skulls</a> (intended to be non-cocoonable, but this behavior is currently bugged)<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-cocoon-list-2&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-cocoon-list-2-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Arachne\" title=\"Arachne\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Arachne in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Spider_Sprite.png/16px-Spider_Sprite.png?4a4b1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Spider_Sprite.png/32px-Spider_Sprite.png?4a4b1 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Arachne\" title=\"Arachne\">Arachne</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Interactions\">Interactions</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cocooning?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Interactions\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cocooning?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Interactions\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>If the cocooned mob is a slayer boss, an additional \"<span class=\"color-red\"><b>YOU COCOONED YOUR SLAYER BOSS</b></span>\" appears in chat, and the next slayer quest skips the spawning phase as if the slayer boss has already spawned.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cocooning?section=4&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Gallery\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cocooning?action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Gallery\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Cocoon_Render.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"A cocoon\"><img alt=\"A cocoon\" src=\"/images/thumb/Cocoon_Render.png/58px-Cocoon_Render.png?c4648\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"58\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Cocoon_Render.png/116px-Cocoon_Render.png?c4648 2x\" data-file-width=\"485\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A cocoon</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Cocoon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"A cocoon segment\"><img alt=\"A cocoon segment\" src=\"/images/thumb/Cocoon.png/120px-Cocoon.png?dce97\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Cocoon.png/240px-Cocoon.png?dce97 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A cocoon segment</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Cocooning_Example.gif\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"An example of a zombie being respawned\"><img alt=\"An example of a zombie being respawned\" src=\"/images/thumb/Cocooning_Example.gif/112px-Cocooning_Example.gif?b403c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"112\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Cocooning_Example.gif/225px-Cocooning_Example.gif?b403c 2x\" data-file-width=\"554\" data-file-height=\"592\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">An example of a zombie being respawned</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cocooning?section=5&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Bugs\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cocooning?action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Bugs\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>If the cocooned mob is a <a href=\"/w/Sea_Creature\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sea Creature\">Sea Creature</a>, the cocooned mob will not be considered as a Sea Creature and can be damaged while the player is wearing <a href=\"/w/Trophy_Hunter_Armor\" class=\"mw-redirect mw-disambig\" title=\"Trophy Hunter Armor\">Trophy Hunter Armor</a>. Additionally, the damage buff towards sea creatures ability on the <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Flaming_Flay\" title=\"Flaming Flay\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Flaming_Flay.png/21px-Flaming_Flay.png?f5845\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Flaming_Flay.png/42px-Flaming_Flay.png?f5845 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Flaming_Flay\" title=\"Flaming Flay\">Flaming Flay</a> and the <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Soul_Whip\" title=\"Soul Whip\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Soul_Whip.png/21px-Soul_Whip.png?63cd7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Soul_Whip.png/42px-Soul_Whip.png?63cd7 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Soul_Whip\" title=\"Soul Whip\">Soul Whip</a> will also not work.</li>\n<li>If a <a href=\"/w/Hidden_Jerry\" title=\"Hidden Jerry\">Hidden Jerry</a> is <b>Cocooned</b>, it does not drop any loot upon being killed.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cocooning?section=6&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cocooning?action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Trivia\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>For mobs such as the <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Fiery_Scuttler\" title=\"Fiery Scuttler\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Fiery Scuttler in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Fiery_Scuttler_Sprite.png/16px-Fiery_Scuttler_Sprite.png?ea7a1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Fiery_Scuttler_Sprite.png/32px-Fiery_Scuttler_Sprite.png?ea7a1 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"288\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Fiery_Scuttler\" title=\"Fiery Scuttler\">Fiery Scuttler</a> where multiple entities belong to one single <a href=\"/w/Sea_Creature\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sea Creature\">Sea Creature</a>, all associated entities are eligible for a cocoon event. The cocoon also will spawn multiple entities instead of the single one that was cocooned.</li>\n<li>If the cocooned mob was a <b>Jawbus Follower</b> summoned by <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Lord_Jawbus\" title=\"Lord Jawbus\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Lord Jawbus in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Iron_Golem_Sprite.png/16px-Iron_Golem_Sprite.png?4a4b1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Iron_Golem_Sprite.png/32px-Iron_Golem_Sprite.png?4a4b1 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"88\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Lord_Jawbus\" title=\"Lord Jawbus\">Lord Jawbus</a>, the cocooned mob will return to its original name instead of keeping the <b>Jawbus Follower</b> name.</li>\n<li>The egg sacs bear a resemblance to the sacs that the <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Tarantula_Broodfather\" title=\"Tarantula Broodfather\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Tarantula Broodfather in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Tarantula_Broodfather_Sprite.png/16px-Tarantula_Broodfather_Sprite.png?d3abc\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Tarantula_Broodfather_Sprite.png/32px-Tarantula_Broodfather_Sprite.png?d3abc 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Tarantula_Broodfather\" title=\"Tarantula Broodfather\">Tarantula Broodfather</a> spawns.</li>\n<li>A cocooned <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Phantom_Spirit\" title=\"Phantom Spirit\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Phantom Spirit in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Phantom_Spirit_Sprite.png/16px-Phantom_Spirit_Sprite.png?bf229\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Phantom_Spirit_Sprite.png/32px-Phantom_Spirit_Sprite.png?bf229 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"288\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Phantom_Spirit\" title=\"Phantom Spirit\">Phantom Spirit</a><sup><i>&#91;<abbr title=\"Confirmation needed; When this info is confirmed, remove this.\">Confirm</abbr>&#93;</i></sup> or <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Timestalk_Clone\" title=\"Timestalk Clone\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Timestalk Clone in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Steve_Sprite.png/16px-Steve_Sprite.png?7ad27\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Steve_Sprite.png/32px-Steve_Sprite.png?7ad27 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Timestalk_Clone\" title=\"Timestalk Clone\">Timestalk Clone</a> (while it could still be cocooned) will randomly take an <a href=\"https://minecraft.wiki/w/Alex\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"mcw:Alex\">Alex</a> or <a href=\"https://minecraft.wiki/w/Steve\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"mcw:Steve\">Steve</a> skin.</li>\n<li>While it is not normally possible to cocoon mobs in <a href=\"/w/The_Rift\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Rift\">The Rift</a> due to no <a href=\"/w/Rift_Dimension#Rift_Transferables\" title=\"Rift Dimension\"><span class=\"color-dark&#95;purple\"><span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-k\" style=\"display: inline-block\">#</span></span></span> Rift-Transferable <span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-k\" style=\"display: inline-block\">#</span></span></span></span></a> item or other mechanic existing to do so, if the player is somehow able to wear <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/The_Primordial\" title=\"The Primordial\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/The_Primordial.png/21px-The_Primordial.png?923bc\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/The_Primordial.png/42px-The_Primordial.png?923bc 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/The_Primordial\" title=\"The Primordial\">The Primordial</a> in the Rift, it is able to cocoon the <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Riftstalker_Bloodfiend\" title=\"Riftstalker Bloodfiend\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Riftstalker Bloodfiend in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Riftstalker_Bloodfiend_Sprite.png/16px-Riftstalker_Bloodfiend_Sprite.png?ba178\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Riftstalker_Bloodfiend_Sprite.png/32px-Riftstalker_Bloodfiend_Sprite.png?ba178 2x\" data-file-width=\"272\" data-file-height=\"272\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Riftstalker_Bloodfiend\" title=\"Riftstalker Bloodfiend\">Riftstalker Bloodfiend</a>.\n<ul><li>This was verified on the <a href=\"/w/Alpha_Hypixel_Network\" title=\"Alpha Hypixel Network\">Alpha Hypixel Network</a> during the release of the feature with the help of <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Centauri\" title=\"Centauri\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Centauri in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Centauri_Sprite.png/16px-Centauri_Sprite.png?6c135\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Centauri_Sprite.png/32px-Centauri_Sprite.png?6c135 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"288\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Centauri\" title=\"Centauri\">Centauri</a>.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"History\">History</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cocooning?section=7&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cocooning?action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: History\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable pixelated\" data-description=\"History\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/Alpha_Hypixel_Network\" title=\"Alpha Hypixel Network\">Alpha Hypixel Network</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2025/July_8\" title=\"Changelog/2025/July 8\">Jul&#160;8,&#160;2025</a></th><th rowspan=\"2\">0.23.1</th><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:The_Primordial.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/The_Primordial.png/26px-The_Primordial.png?923bc\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/The_Primordial.png/52px-The_Primordial.png?923bc 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span> Added <b><a href=\"/w/The_Primordial\" title=\"The Primordial\">The Primordial</a></b>.</td></tr><tr><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Shriveled_Cornea.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Shriveled_Cornea.png/26px-Shriveled_Cornea.png?83133\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Shriveled_Cornea.png/52px-Shriveled_Cornea.png?83133 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span> Added <a href=\"/w/Shriveled_Cornea\" title=\"Shriveled Cornea\">Shriveled Cornea</a>.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2026/April_30\" title=\"Changelog/2026/April 30\">Apr&#160;30,&#160;2026</a></th><td>Added a message when <b>Cocooning</b> a <a href=\"/w/Mob\" title=\"Mob\">Mob</a>.</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Prototype\" title=\"SkyBlock Prototype\">SkyBlock Prototype</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2025/July_22\" title=\"Changelog/2025/July 22\">Jul&#160;22,&#160;2025</a></th><th rowspan=\"2\">0.23.2</th><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:The_Primordial.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/The_Primordial.png/26px-The_Primordial.png?923bc\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/The_Primordial.png/52px-The_Primordial.png?923bc 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span> Added <a href=\"/w/The_Primordial\" title=\"The Primordial\">The Primordial</a>.</td></tr><tr><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Shriveled_Cornea.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Shriveled_Cornea.png/26px-Shriveled_Cornea.png?83133\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Shriveled_Cornea.png/52px-Shriveled_Cornea.png?83133 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span> Added <a href=\"/w/Shriveled_Cornea\" title=\"Shriveled Cornea\">Shriveled Cornea</a>.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\">Jul&#160;10,&#160;2025</th><td>Disabled <b>Cocooning</b>.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2026/January_12\" title=\"Changelog/2026/January 12\">Jan&#160;12,&#160;2026</a></th><td>Re-enabled <b>Cocooning</b>.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2026/May_6\" title=\"Changelog/2026/May 6\">May&#160;6,&#160;2026</a></th><th rowspan=\"2\">0.24.5</th><td>Added a message when <b>Cocooning</b> a <a href=\"/w/Mob\" title=\"Mob\">Mob</a>.</td></tr><tr><td><b>Cocooned</b> mobs now belong to the player who cocooned them</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"References\">References</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cocooning?section=8&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cocooning?action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: References\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-cocoon-list-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-cocoon-list_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/651912910972649492/1529181650641228007/1529870627932999903\">Discord message</a> from a Hypixel staff member in a restricted channel in the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://discord.gg/E2MayyR9a3\">Hypixel SkyBlock Wiki</a> server &#8211; @mrkeith, July 23, 2026, 11:19 AM (EST). <div class=\"quotebox\">\n<div class=\"quotebox-image-left\"><div class=\"msgbox-content\"><span class=\"themeinvert-dark notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"/images/thumb/Quote2_black.png/50px-Quote2_black.png?77a7c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Quote2_black.png/100px-Quote2_black.png?77a7c 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></span></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"quotebox-text\"><div class=\"msgbox-content\">the master list they both check are as follows:\n<pre>mobs CANNOT be:\n\n- riding any other entity to prevent double cocoons (only the vehicle entity can be cocooned in these cases)\n- for the primordial, entity must be a slayer boss OR must be a slayer follower\n\n- sven pups\n- jockey skeletons\n- all nether minibosses and related entities\n- siamese lynx\n- end stone protector\n- any dragon\n- chickzilla\n- scatha or scatha similar entities\n- wiki tiki or its laser totems\n- any trapper entity\n- either duelist from crimson isle quest\n- primordial bats &amp; spiders\n- most fish shard entities, including lotus atoll\n- green shulker shard\n- growing panda shard\n- sphinx\n- timestalk clones\n- zombuddies\n- puddle jumper\n</pre></div></div>\n<div class=\"quotebox-image-right\"><div class=\"msgbox-content\"><span class=\"themeinvert-dark notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"/images/thumb/Quote2_black.png/50px-Quote2_black.png?77a7c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Quote2_black.png/100px-Quote2_black.png?77a7c 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></span></span></div></div>\n</div></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-cocoon-list-2-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-cocoon-list-2_2-0\">a</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-cocoon-list-2_2-1\">b</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/651912910972649492/1529181650641228007/1530647811190685968\">Discord message</a> from a Hypixel staff member in a restricted channel in the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://discord.gg/E2MayyR9a3\">Hypixel SkyBlock Wiki</a> server &#8211; @pikachuflare, July 25, 2026, 2:47 PM (EST). <div class=\"quotebox\">\n<div class=\"quotebox-image-left\"><div class=\"msgbox-content\"><span class=\"themeinvert-dark notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"/images/thumb/Quote2_black.png/50px-Quote2_black.png?77a7c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Quote2_black.png/100px-Quote2_black.png?77a7c 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></span></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"quotebox-text\"><div class=\"msgbox-content\">the official designer intent is this regarding what can't be cocooned: \n<p>- Anything in Dungeons\n- Anything defined as a BOSS\n</p>\n  - Barbarian Duke X, Ashfang, Bladesoul, Mage Outlaw, and Magma Boss are now classified as bosses and therefore won’t be affected by the ability.</div></div>\n<div class=\"quotebox-image-right\"><div class=\"msgbox-content\"><span class=\"themeinvert-dark notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"/images/thumb/Quote2_black.png/50px-Quote2_black.png?77a7c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Quote2_black.png/100px-Quote2_black.png?77a7c 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></span></span></div></div>\n</div></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mediawiki‐jobrunner‐847db4cdb‐9jtpz\nCached time: 20261023053634\nCache expiry: 172800\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐